    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500211/1015002010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あんまりソファで眠っていると、\r\n身体を痛くするぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちゃんと家に帰った方がいい……\r\n──甜花",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002010030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……ふえっ……\r\nあ、えと…………おはようございます……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500211/1015002010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、おはよう\r\nもう夕方だけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002010040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "夕方……！？\r\nた、たくさん寝ちゃった……ふあぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500211/1015002010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、甜花があんまり気持ちよさそうで、\r\n俺もなかなか起こせなかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002010050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……にへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500211/1015002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002010060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花、今日のレッスンも……頑張った……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500211/1015002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002010070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だから、ご褒美……！\r\nいっぱい、お昼寝……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500211/1015002010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかそうか。そのご褒美は大切だな\r\nゆっくり休めたか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002010080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……！\r\n夢の中でも……寝てた……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101500211/1015002010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、夢の中でもか？\r\n甜花は本当に眠り姫だなあ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1015002010110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\n夢でも、ぽかぽか……ひなたぼっこ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
